# <PROJECT> — Local Session State (gitignored)

Rename to `CLAUDE.local.md` and use for per-machine notes, session-to-session
state, and anything that doesn't belong in the committed AGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md.

## Deployment / scheduling

- Host: (e.g. always-on Mac Studio)
- launchd label: `com.<you>.<project>` — plist + wrapper under `launchd/`
- Log dir: `<log-directory>`
- Notification script: `<path-to-notification-script>` (failure-only)

## Secrets (locations only — never values here)

Config names the env var; the value lives out of band:

- `TOOLNAME_TOKEN` — API token; supplied by your secret store as an environment
  variable at wrapper start.

## End-of-session workflow

- For a release: feature branch → Conventional Commit → push when requested →
  PR (`gh pr create`) → wait for CI → squash-merge and delete the branch.
- If work revealed durable repo facts, update `AGENTS.md` in the code PR before
  merging. After release, update this local session log.
- Never auto-push; confirm before destructive operations.

## Session Log

Record ongoing work here between sessions; trim to the last ~10 entries.
